  <name>Devtox</name>
  <summary>Lightweight browser for developers, with a built-in terminal</summary>
  <summary xml:lang="it">Browser leggero per sviluppatori, con terminale integrato</summary>
  <description>
    <p>Devtox puts a WebKit browser and a real terminal in the same window,
    with a command palette for every action and privacy protections on by default.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Built-in terminal and the dx command to drive the browser from the shell</li>
      <li>Command palette, local dev server detection, network log, responsive view</li>
      <li>HTTPS-only, tracker blocklist, anti-fingerprinting, Global Privacy Control</li>
      <li>Optional local AI assistant through Ollama</li>
      <li>No telemetry, no accounts, no update pings</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
